                      Table "public.qualitative_signals"
       Column        |          Type          | Collation | Nullable | Default 
---------------------+------------------------+-----------+----------+---------
 signal_id           | character varying(50)  |           | not null | 
 account_id          | integer                |           | not null | 
 signal_date         | date                   |           | not null | 
 signal_type         | character varying(50)  |           |          | 
 stakeholder_level   | character varying(50)  |           |          | 
 stakeholder_title   | character varying(255) |           |          | 
 content             | text                   |           |          | 
 sentiment           | character varying(50)  |           |          | 
 sentiment_score     | numeric(5,2)           |           |          | 
 keywords            | text                   |           |          | 
 is_narrative_signal | boolean                |           |          | 
Indexes:
    "qualitative_signals_pkey" PRIMARY KEY, btree (signal_id)
    "idx_qualitative_signals_account" btree (account_id)
    "idx_qualitative_signals_date" btree (signal_date)
    "idx_qualitative_signals_sentiment" btree (sentiment)
    "idx_qualitative_signals_type" btree (signal_type)
Foreign-key constraints:
    "qualitative_signals_account_id_fkey" FOREIGN KEY (account_id) REFERENCES accounts(account_id)

